    <p class="winbar"><span class="file">whoami.pdf</span><span class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="meta">revised June 2026</span></p>

    <header class="ds-head">
      <p class="ds-part">MN-2026</p>
      <h2 class="ds-title">About</h2>
    </header>

    <p class="prose ds-desc">I study computer science at Stellenbosch University and have been a teaching assistant for introductory computer science and computer architecture. I like understanding things all the way down, from a line of C to the gates that run it, and I’m happiest when that ends in something I built: a scheduler, a compiler, or a computer on breadboards. Away from that I’m a linguistics nerd and a free-software advocate.</p>

