    <div class="ctf">
      <h3 class="ds-h">Capture the flag</h3>
      <p>Three flags are hidden on this site, the kind you would find in a beginner CTF. They look like <code>{"flag{…}"}</code>. Found one? Run <kbd>M-x</kbd> <code>submit-flag</code>, or use the button.</p>
      <p class="ctf-row"><button type="button" class="btn" data-ctf="submit">submit a flag</button><span class="ctf-progress" aria-live="polite">0 of 3 found</span></p>
