  <footer class="foot">
    <p>Made with HTML, CSS, JavaScript and Emacs, without a framework, a build step or cookies.</p>
    <p class="dim">Press <kbd>SPC</kbd> for commands or <kbd>M-x</kbd> to run one by name.</p>
