      <dl>
        <div><dt><kbd>SPC</kbd></dt><dd>leader key: shows every command</dd></div>
        <div><dt><kbd>M-x</kbd></dt><dd>run a command by name (Alt+x or Option+x)</dd></div>
        <div><dt><kbd>SPC h t</kbd></dt><dd>load a theme, with live preview</dd></div>
        <div><dt><kbd>:</kbd></dt><dd>evil ex commands, like <code>:q</code></dd></div>
        <div><dt><kbd>C-g</kbd></dt><dd>cancel (so does <kbd>esc</kbd>)</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>On this page</h3>
      <dl>
        <div><dt><kbd>c</kbd> <kbd>n</kbd> <kbd>r</kbd></dt><dd>computer: run or pause, step, reset</dd></div>
        <div><dt><kbd>TAB</kbd></dt><dd>fold the Org heading under focus</dd></div>
        <div><dt><kbd>S-TAB</kbd></dt><dd>cycle the whole Org buffer</dd></div>
        <div><dt><code>coffee-refill</code></dt><dd>top up VCC and overclock the computer</dd></div>
        <div><dt><code>submit-flag</code></dt><dd>check a CTF flag</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
  <form method="dialog"><button class="btn" type="submit">close</button></form>
</dialog>
</body>
</html>
